{
  "about": "How each of the 56 places orders candidates on the printed ballot, by statute. Main source is Ballotpedia's rules page (as of October 2026), which lists one rule per state and often covers only the general election; where it was silent on primaries, the primary is assumed or marked an estimate. NCSL's Order of Names on the Ballot (as of March 3, 2025) could not be fetched and was used only as a cross-check from the figures given in the task. Territory rules (PR, GU, VI, AS, MP) were not found and are estimates. Statute sections are as Ballotpedia cites them; they were not checked against state code sites.",
